ning the military: up to 20,000 RMB per year for tuition, two-year extension of student status, and a special postgraduate admission program"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/31-05","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Only six scenarios allow the government to assign jobs after discharge; those opting for self-employment must register within 30 days"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Three key financial aspects after discharge: one-time separation pay, military service counting toward work seniority, and tax deductions for self-employed veterans"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"There’s more than just civil service exams to get into the government system: serving two years in grassroots programs qualifies you for a special recruitment quota of 10% each year"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Teachers in the Special Post Program who complete three years of service, pass evaluations, and wish to stay should be promptly added to the official teaching staff"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Firefighters and civilian personnel in the military represent two additional pathways for public recruitment, with lower entry requirements than civil service exams"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Education is not a one-time deal: self-study exams have no age or prior education limits; both adult college entrance exams and open universities offer pathways to further education"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Not joining a company means you must arrange your own social insurance: you’ll need to enroll in pension and medical plans at your place of work, as household registration restrictions have now been lifted"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Food delivery workers, ride‑hailing drivers, and local freight carriers all get occupational injury coverage paid for by the platform on a per‑order basis — at no cost to them"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Two pathways to secure a government job on the day you fill out college applications: government-funded teacher training and targeted medical student programs, at the cost of a six-year service commitment"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Before going abroad to work, check whether the company has a license for international labor cooperation: it is illegal for them to demand a deposit from you"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Working remotely for a foreign company from home: this income is considered domestic earnings for tax purposes; you must file your own individual income tax returns, and incoming payments should be reported as “employee compensation”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Starting a business without joining a company? First look at startup guarantee loans: up to 300,000 RMB per individual, with the government covering half the interest"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/31"},"children":["Chapter 31"," ·"," ","What options are available after turning 18?"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"31-05"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["05"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Only six scenarios allow the government to assign jobs after discharge; those opting for self-employment must register within 30 days"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["The notion that “the military guarantees job placement” no longer applies broadly. Currently, only six specific scenarios qualify for government job assignments. Most conscripts who serve two years do not fall into these categories. Those not eligible for government placement are considered self-employed, and they must register within 30 days of discharge. Failing to do so without valid reasons means they forfeit any entitlement to government assistance."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["No cost involved. Simply bring your discharge certificate…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["Article 25 of the Regulations on Placement of Veterans specifies six circumstances under which local governmen…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Only six scenarios allow the government to assign jobs after discharge; those opting for self-employment must register within 30 days"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","vie